        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Reach Sporeggar Exalted with repeatable hibiscus turn-ins and gather 10 Glowcaps for the tabard.\n\n1. Check Sporeggar reputation; either faction can earn it. If already Exalted, skip to step 5. Otherwise set Dungeon Difficulty to NORMAL and go to the underwater pipe at Serpent Lake, Zangarmarsh (50.4, 40.9).\n\n2. Swim through the pipe, surface in Coilfang Reservoir and take the right-hand Underbog portal (54.2, 34.5). Speak to T'shu just inside and accept Bring Me A Shrubbery! (29691). This Retail quest does not require the old outdoor Friendly-reputation unlock.\n\n3. Pick the glowing Sanguine Hibiscus flowers and loot hibiscus from dungeon enemies. Clear the opening bog-creature section through Hungarfen toward the first naga, then return to T'shu. Herbalism is not required to pick these quest flowers; kills also award Sporeggar reputation.\n\n4. Hand T'shu 5 Sanguine Hibiscus, then repeat Bring Me Another Shrubbery! (29692), five flowers per turn-in, until Exalted. Leave and reset Normal instances for more flowers as needed. Bought hibiscus work too. From exactly Neutral, with no reputation bonuses or kill reputation, the comments' baseline is 280 flowers; check your actual standing before buying.\n\n5. Collect 10 Glowcaps from the small mushrooms around western Zangarmarsh, or buy them from players. Keep these separate from Sanguine Hibiscus: Glowcaps pay for the tabard. Reserve another 30 only if you also want the Tiny Sporebat pet.\n\n6. Visit Mycah at Sporeggar (17.8, 51.2). At Exalted, buy Sporeggar Tabard for 10 Glowcaps and equip it. Reaching the start of Exalted is sufficient; you do not need to fill its final 999-point bar.",
