        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Farm ogres and repeatable warbead turn-ins to Exalted with the correct faction.\n\n1. Use an Alliance character and check Kurenai reputation. At Exalted, skip to step 6. The Horde counterpart is The Mag'har, and this guide uses Outland Nagrand rather than the Draenor version of that zone.\n\n2. For the quest route, start with the Kurenai at Orebor Harborage in northern Zangarmarsh (41.5, 27.2), then continue their quests at Telaar in southern Nagrand. These establish friendly access and provide a substantial part of the grind. Ogre kills can also build reputation before the quest hubs open.\n\n3. Farm Warmaul ogres at Laughing Skull Ruins in northern Nagrand (46.0, 23.0). Kill and loot every ogre for direct Kurenai reputation and Obsidian Warbeads (25433). These are the beads you need, not Oshu'gun Crystal Powder Samples.\n\n4. If that area is occupied, farm the ogres at Warmaul Hill and its caves (29.0, 26.0). Keep the beads and return to Telaar between farming sessions.\n\n5. At Telaar, take 10 Obsidian Warbeads to Warden Moi'bff Jill (54.8, 70.8). Complete Fierce Enemies, then repeat More Warbeads! for 500 base Kurenai reputation per 10 beads. Continue ogre kills and turn-ins to Exalted. Do not give those beads to the Consortium while working on this tabard.\n\n6. Buy Kurenai Tabard from Trader Narasu at Telaar (54.5, 75.1), near the flight master, for up to 1 gold before discounts. Equip it to learn the appearance. The same reputation unlocks the Kurenai talbuks, bought separately.",
