        itemId = 31778,
        name = "Lower City Tabard",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Reach Exalted with repeatable legacy dungeon clears, then buy the tabard.\n\n1. Check Lower City reputation on the purchasing character. Either faction can collect the tabard. If already Exalted, skip to step 5. Aldor/Scryer allegiance does not prevent earning Lower City reputation.\n\n2. For early reputation, take the Lower City quests in Shattrath and the refugee-camp quests in the Bone Wastes. Arakkoa Feather turn-ins with Vekax in Lower City help through Friendly, but cannot finish the Exalted grind.\n\n3. Set Dungeon Difficulty to NORMAL and enter Shadow Labyrinth, the south wing of Auchindoun in Terokkar Forest, with its portal around 39.6, 73.5. Clear the cultists, demons and bosses. This dungeon grants Lower City reputation all the way to Exalted.\n\n4. Run back to the entrance, leave and reset Normal instances for another clear. Loot Marks of Sargeras and Fel Armaments if you also want Aldor reputation; those items are separate turn-ins and are not needed to receive Lower City kill reputation. Heroic Auchindoun clears are optional additional reputation.\n\n5. At Exalted, return to Nakodu in Shattrath's Lower City market (62.0, 69.0). Buy Lower City Tabard for up to 1 gold before discounts, then equip it. He is not the Aldor quartermaster or the vendor beside A'dal.",
