        itemId = 31779,
        name = "Aldor Tabard",
        stepCount = 6,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Choose the matching Shattrath faction and gather or buy its reputation turn-ins to Exalted.\n\n1. Choose a character for the Aldor grind. Both factions can join, but gaining Aldor reputation lowers Scryer reputation on that character. If already Aldor Exalted, skip to step 5. Using different characters for the two tabards avoids rebuilding a hostile reputation.\n\n2. In Shattrath, take A'dal from the Haggard War Veteran and speak to A'dal at the Terrace of Light (54.0, 44.6). Take City of Light from Khadgar beside him (54.6, 44.0), follow the summoned servant's city tour, then choose Allegiance to the Aldor. Follow Ishanah to the Aldor Rise temple.\n\n3. For a direct turn-in route, buy Fel Armaments (29740), or loot them from eligible Outland demons. Ishanah in the Aldor temple (24.2, 29.8) accepts A Cleansing Light and its repeatable hand-ins. Each armament gives 350 base Aldor reputation. From exactly Neutral with no bonuses or other reputation, 120 armaments cover the 42,000 points to Exalted; buy fewer if quests or your starting standing already supplied some.\n\n4. For self-farming, clear Normal Shadow Labyrinth in southern Auchindoun, Terokkar Forest (39.6, 73.5), and loot its demons/cultists for Fel Armaments and Marks of Sargeras. Return to Ishanah for armaments and Adyen the Lightwarden on Aldor Rise (30.6, 34.4) for eligible mark hand-ins. Dungeon kills themselves award Lower City, so the Aldor reputation arrives when you turn in the items.\n\n5. At Aldor Exalted, go to Quartermaster Endarin on Aldor Rise (47.5, 26.3). Buy Aldor Tabard for up to 1 gold before discounts. Ishanah takes armaments; Endarin sells the tabard. They are different NPCs at different ends of the Rise.\n\n6. Equip the tabard and check the learned appearance before changing allegiance or disposing of it. The physical item requires Aldor Exalted to equip; do not plan around keeping it equipped forever after switching to Scryers. Finish any Aldor recipes and other purchases you want before switching.",
