        itemId = 31780,
        name = "Scryers Tabard",
        stepCount = 6,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Choose the matching Shattrath faction and gather or buy its reputation turn-ins to Exalted.\n\n1. Choose a character for the Scryers. Both factions can join, but Scryer gains reduce Aldor reputation on that character. Already Scryer Exalted characters can skip to step 5. An alt with no allegiance is usually simpler than reversing an Aldor grind.\n\n2. Complete Shattrath's introduction: speak to A'dal at 54.0, 44.6, then take City of Light from Khadgar at 54.6, 44.0 and follow his servant. Choose Allegiance to the Scryers, then complete the introduction to Voren'thal the Seer on Scryer's Tier.\n\n3. Buy Arcane Tomes (29739), or farm them from eligible Outland blood elves. Voren'thal inside the Seer's Library (42.6, 91.4) accepts Synthesis of Power and repeatable Arcane Tome hand-ins, worth 350 base reputation each. From exactly Neutral with no other gains, 120 tomes cover Exalted; your starting standing, quests and bonuses change the number needed.\n\n4. To farm your own items, set NORMAL and clear the blood elf sections of The Botanica in Netherstorm (71.7, 54.9). Loot Arcane Tomes and Sunfury Signets; clear the rest and use the exit behind the final boss, or return outside and reset. Give eligible signet batches to Magistrix Fyalenn on Scryer's Tier (45.4, 81.4), and tomes to Voren'thal. Botanica kills award The Sha'tar, not Scryer reputation: the Scryer gains come from these hand-ins.\n\n5. At Scryers Exalted, visit Quartermaster Enuril (60.4, 64.0) on Scryer's Tier. He is separate from Fyalenn and the Seer's Library. Buy Scryers Tabard for up to 1 gold before discounts.\n\n6. Equip the tabard and confirm the appearance. Finish other Scryer purchases before switching to Aldor: the physical tabard requires Scryers Exalted to equip again, even if you owned it earlier. Do not rely on the old leave-it-equipped workaround.",
