        itemId = 31781,
        name = "Sha'tar Tabard",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Reach Exalted with repeatable legacy dungeon clears, then buy the tabard.\n\n1. Check The Sha'tar reputation. Either faction and either Aldor/Scryer allegiance can collect this tabard. If already Exalted, skip to step 5. Sha'tari Skyguard and the Draenor Sha'tari Defense are different reputations.\n\n2. Fly to Tempest Keep in eastern Netherstorm and enter The Botanica, the northern side satellite at 71.7, 54.9. Set Dungeon Difficulty to NORMAL. Entering The Eye, the central raid building, does not follow this reputation route.\n\n3. Clear Botanica's trash and bosses for The Sha'tar reputation, including the blood elf rooms and plant sections. Use the exit behind Warp Splinter to return outside, reset Normal instances, then repeat. Normal kills continue giving reputation toward Exalted.\n\n4. For variety, The Mechanar (70.6, 69.8) and The Arcatraz (74.4, 57.7) also award this faction's reputation. Their Heroic versions, and Heroic Botanica, are optional daily clears. Save Botanica's Arcane Tomes and Sunfury Signets if also working on Scryers, but those are separate item turn-ins.\n\n5. At Exalted, return to Almaador beside A'dal on Shattrath's Terrace of Light (51.2, 41.6). Buy Sha'tar Tabard for up to 1 gold before discounts and equip it. Do not buy a Skyguard tabard from Grella by mistake.",
