        itemId = 31777,
        name = "Keepers of Time Tabard",
        stepCount = 7,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Reach Exalted with repeatable legacy dungeon clears, then buy the tabard.\n\n1. Check Keepers of Time reputation. This tabard belongs to the Bronze dragons' original Caverns of Time faction, not the later Timewalkers. If already Exalted, skip to step 6.\n\n2. Go to the Caverns of Time entrance in Tanaris (64.8, 49.9), descend into the cavern and speak to the Steward of Time. Complete To The Master's Lair and Andormu's Caverns of Time tour if you have not already done the introduction. Let the guide finish before leaving.\n\n3. Follow the original Old Hillsbrad chain: take Old Hillsbrad and enter the Escape from Durnholde dungeon. Speak to Erozion near the entrance cave (28.8, 48.2 on the Old Hillsbrad map), then travel to Durnholde around 68.6, 69.6. Plant the incendiary bombs in its five internment lodges, turn in to Thrall in the keep, and escort him through the event to Tarren Mill around 50.5, 31.6. Turn in the follow-up and return to Andormu. This introduces the original Black Morass route.\n\n4. Set Dungeon Difficulty to NORMAL and enter The Black Morass, also called Opening of the Dark Portal. On the Caverns of Time map its portal is around 37.2, 83.3. Complete the initial quest with Sa'at if offered and approach Medivh to begin the event.\n\n5. Find Medivh around 48.7, 72.0 on The Black Morass map and defend him through all 18 portals. Kill each Rift Lord/Rift Keeper and the three bosses rather than only the incidental wildlife; the timed event supplies the reputation. After Aeonus, turn in any available event quest, leave, reset Normal instances and repeat to Exalted. Heroic Black Morass and Heroic Old Hillsbrad are optional daily additions.\n\n6. Visit Alurmi inside the Caverns of Time at 40.0, 77.0 on the interior Caverns of Time map. She is the Keepers of Time Quartermaster, not an outdoor vendor on the surface of Tanaris. Buy Keepers of Time Tabard for up to 1 gold before discounts.\n\n7. Equip the tabard and check the appearance. You do not need an old Heroic key, a raid attunement or a Timewalking event to buy it. Wearing it does not turn unrelated dungeon kills into Keepers of Time reputation.",
